eedom from Abuse, Neglect, and Exploitation Deficiencies","concept":"resident_rights","concept_label":"Resident rights & abuse/neglect"},"cms-f0610":{"code":"F-0610","title":"Respond appropriately to all alleged violations.","category":"Freedom from Abuse, Neglect, and Exploitation Deficiencies","concept":"resident_rights","concept_label":"Resident rights & abuse/neglect"},"cms-f0686":{"code":"F-0686","title":"Provide appropriate pressure ulcer care and prevent new ulcers from developing.","category":"Quality of Life and Care Deficiencies","concept":"clinical_care","concept_label":"Clinical care"},"cms-f0689":{"code":"F-0689","title":"Ensure that a nursing home area is free from accident hazards and provides adequate supervision to prevent accidents.","category":"Quality of Life and Care Deficiencies","concept":"clinical_care","concept_label":"Clinical care"},"cms-f0690":{"code":"F-0690","title":"Provide appropriate care for residents who are continent or incontinent of bowel/bladder, appropriate catheter care,  and appropriate care  to prevent urinary tract infections.","category":"Quality of Life and Care Deficiencies","concept":"clinical_care","concept_label":"Clinical care"},"cms-f0756":{"code":"F-0756","title":"Ensure a licensed pharmacist perform a monthly drug regimen review, including the medical chart, following irregularity reporting guidelines in developed policies and procedures.","category":"Pharmacy Service Deficiencies","concept":"medication","concept_label":"Medication management"},"cms-f0760":{"code":"F-0760","title":"Ensure that residents are free from significant medication errors.","category":"Pharmacy Service Deficiencies","concept":"medication","concept_label":"Medication management"},"cms-f0580":{"code":"F-0580","title":"Immediately tell the resident, the resident's doctor, and a family member of situations (injury/decline/room, etc.)  that affect the resident.","category":"Resident Rights Deficiencies","concept":"resident_rights","concept_label":"Resident rights & abuse/neglect"},"cms-f0692":{"code":"F-0692","title":"Provide enough food/fluids to maintain a resident's health.","category":"Quality of Life and Care Deficiencies","concept":"clinical_care","concept_label":"Clinical care"},"cms-k0232":{"code":"K-0232","title":"Have corridors or aisles that are unobstructed and are at least 8 feet in width.","category":"Egress Deficiencies","concept":"environment_life_safety","concept_label":"Environment & life safety"},"cms-k0222":{"code":"K-0222","title":"Add doors in an exit area that do not require the use of a key from the exit side unless in case of special locking arrangements.","category":"Egress Deficiencies","concept":"environment_life_safety","concept_label":"Environment & life safety"},"cms-k0321":{"code":"K-0321","title":"Ensure that special areas are constructed so that walls can resist fire for one hour or have an approved fire extinguishing system.","category":"Smoke Deficiencies","concept":"environment_life_safety","concept_label":"Environment & life safety"},"cms-k0363":{"code":"K-0363","title":"Install corridor and hallway doors that block smoke.","category":"Smoke Deficiencies","concept":"environment_life_safety","concept_label":"Environment & life safety"},"cms-k0920":{"code":"K-0920","title":"Ensure proper usage of power strips and extension cords.","category":"Gas, Vacuum, and Electrical Systems Deficiencies","concept":"environment_life_safety","concept_label":"Environment & life safety"},"cms-f0812":{"code":"F-0812","title":"Procure food from sources approved or considered satisfactory and store, prepare, distribute and serve food in accordance with professional standards.","category":"Nutrition and Dietary Deficiencies","concept":"food_nutrition","concept_label":"Food, nutrition & hydration"},"cms-f0609":{"code":"F-0609","title":"Timely report suspected abuse, neglect, or theft and report the results of the investigation to proper authorities.","category":"Freedom from Abuse, Neglect, and Exploitation Deficiencies","concept":"resident_rights","concept_label":"Resident rights & abuse/neglect"},"cms-f0695":{"code":"F-0695","title":"Provide safe and appropriate respiratory care for a resident when needed.","category":"Quality of Life and Care Deficiencies","concept":"clinical_care","concept_label":"Clinical care"},"cms-f0699":{"code":"F-0699","title":"Provide care or services that was trauma informed and/or culturally competent.","category":"Quality of Life and Care Deficiencies","concept":"clinical_care","concept_label":"Clinical care"},"cms-f0757":{"code":"F-0757","title":"Ensure each resident’s drug regimen must be free from unnecessary drugs.","category":"Pharmacy Service Deficiencies","concept":"medication","concept_label":"Medication management"},"cms-f0759":{"code":"F-0759","title":"Ensure medication error rates are not 5 percent or greater.","category":"Pharmacy Service Deficiencies","concept":"medication","concept_label":"Medication management"},"cms-f0808":{"code":"F-0808","title":"Ensure therapeutic diets are prescribed by the attending physician and may be delegated to a registered or licensed dietitian, to the extent allowed by State law.","category":"Nutrition and Dietary Deficiencies","concept":"food_nutrition","concept_label":"Food, nutrition & hydration"},"cms-k0712":{"code":"K-0712","title":"Have simulated fire drills held at unexpected times.","category":"Miscellaneous Deficiencies","concept":"environment_life_safety","concept_label":"Environment & life safety"},"cms-k0351":{"code":"K-0351","title":"Install an approved automatic sprinkler system.","category":"Smoke Deficiencies","concept":"environment_life_safety","concept_label":"Environment & life safety"},"cms-k0923":{"code":"K-0923","title":"Have proper medical gas storage and administration areas.","category":"Gas, Vacuum, and Electrical Systems Deficiencies","concept":"environment_life_safety","concept_label":"Environment & life safety"},"cms-f0584":{"code":"F-0584","title":"Honor the resident's right to a safe, clean, comfortable and homelike environment, including but not limited to receiving treatment and supports for daily living safely.","category":"Resident Rights Deficiencies","concept":"resident_rights","concept_label":"Resident rights & abuse/neglect"},"cms-f0628":{"code":"F-0628","title":"Provide the required documentation or notification related to the resident's needs, appeal rights, or bed-hold policies.","category":"Resident Rights Deficiencies","concept":"resident_rights","concept_label":"Resident rights & abuse/neglect"},"cms-f0585":{"code":"F-0585","title":"Honor the resident's right to voice grievances without discrimination or reprisal and the facility must establish a grievance policy and make prompt efforts to resolve grievances.","category":"Resident Rights Deficiencies","concept":"resident_rights","concept_label":"Resident rights & abuse/neglect"},"cms-f0600":{"code":"F-0600","title":"Protect each resident from all types of abuse such as physical, mental, sexual abuse, physical punishment, and neglect by anybody.","category":"Freedom from Abuse, Neglect, and Exploitation Deficiencies","concept":"resident_rights","concept_label":"Resident rights & abuse/neglect"},"cms-f0638":{"code":"F-0638","title":"Assure that each resident’s assessment is updated at least once every 3 months.","category":"Resident Assessment and Care Planning Deficiencies","concept":"clinical_care","concept_label":"Clinical care"},"cms-f0641":{"code":"F-0641","title":"Ensure each resident receives an accurate assessment.","category":"Resident Assessment and Care Planning Deficiencies","concept":"clinical_care","concept_label":"Clinical care"},"cms-f0655":{"code":"F-0655","title":"Create and put into place a plan for meeting the resident's most immediate needs within 48 hours of being admitted","category":"Resident Assessment and Care Planning Deficiencies","concept":"clinical_care","concept_label":"Clinical care"},"cms-f0657":{"code":"F-0657",